==Old High German==

===Etymology===
Common Germanic *''[[habhen]]'', whence also Old English ''[[habban]]'', Old Norse ''[[hafa]]''. It is
related to Latin ''[[capere]]''.

===Verb===
'''habēn'''

# to [[have]]

